      "label": "text",
      "text": "The median pharmacokinetic parameters of ustekinumab following a single SC administration in adult patients with psoriasis are shown in Table 14. The pharmacokinetic parameters of ustekinumab (CL/F, Vz/F, and t1/2) were generally comparable between 45 mg and 90 mg subcutaneous doses.",
